---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free Frisco Stargazing RSVP | Breck Sky Fest" description="Free RSVP for Frisco Historic Park Stargazing on November 27, 2026. Drop in anytime from 5:30–7:30 PM MST.">
<PageIntro eyebrow="Free admission · $0" title="RSVP for Frisco stargazing." description="Friday, November 27, 2026 · Frisco Historic Park · 5:30–7:30 PM MST. Drop in anytime and stay as long as you like within the program hours." icon="stars"/>
<section class="section paper-section"><div class="wrap"><p>RSVP is required so we can plan ahead, provide enough equipment for everyone, and let you know about important weather updates, including postponement or cancellation. The event is free; there is no payment step. You do not need to arrive exactly at 5:30 PM.</p><form class="rsvp-form" id="frisco-rsvp" action="/api/rsvp" method="post"><label for="attendee-name">Attendee name</label><input id="attendee-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/><label for="attendee-email">Email address</label><input id="attendee-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/><label for="attendee-count">Number of people attending (including you)</label><input id="attendee-count" type="number" inputmode="numeric" name="people" min="1" max="500" step="1" value="1" required/><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this blank</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:20px;font-size:1rem">Your name, email, and group size will be stored by the festival team for attendance planning and updates about this event.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Submit free RSVP · $0</button><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><div class="rsvp-confirmation" id="rsvp-confirmation" tabindex="-1" hidden><h2>You’re on the list.</h2><p>Your free RSVP has been saved for Frisco Historic Park Stargazing on Friday, November 27, 2026.</p><p>Drop in anytime between 5:30 and 7:30 PM MST. We’ll use your email to contact you if weather forces a postponement or cancellation.</p><p id="rsvp-reference"></p><a class="text-link" href="/program/frisco-historic-park-stargazing/">Back to event details</a></div><p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="text-link" href="/program/frisco-historic-park-stargazing/">See the full event details</a></p></div></section>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#frisco-rsvp');
form?.addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;const status=form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.form-status')!;button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Saving your RSVP…';try{const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form),headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.');form.hidden=true;const confirmation=document.getElementById('rsvp-confirmation')!;document.getElementById('rsvp-reference')!.textContent=`RSVP reference: ${result.id}`;confirmation.hidden=false;confirmation.focus();}catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.';}finally{button.disabled=false;}});
</script>
</Layout>
